      "minutes": 9,
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "pattern",
          "title": {
            "en": "Zero and first conditionals",
            "hi": "Zero और first conditional"
          },
          "visual": "cards",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "If you heat ice, it melts.",
              "hi": "बर्फ़ गरम करो तो वह पिघलती है। (हमेशा सच)"
            },
            {
              "en": "If plants don't get light, they turn yellow.",
              "hi": "पौधों को रोशनी न मिले तो वे पीले पड़ जाते हैं।"
            },
            {
              "en": "If it rains tomorrow, we will play indoors.",
              "hi": "अगर कल बारिश हुई, तो हम अंदर खेलेंगे। (एक संभावना)"
            },
            {
              "en": "If you study regularly, you will do well.",
              "hi": "नियम से पढ़ोगे तो अच्छा करोगे।"
            },
            {
              "en": "We will miss the train if we don't leave now.",
              "hi": "अभी नहीं निकले तो ट्रेन छूट जाएगी।"
            }
          ],
          "note": {
            "en": "Zero: if + present, present, for facts. First: if + present, will + verb, for a real future chance. Never use will after if.",
            "hi": "Zero: if + present, present (सच्चाई)। First: if + present, will + क्रिया (भविष्य की संभावना)। If के बाद will नहीं।"
          }
        },
        {
